<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya-sama... I believe in you.</font>

32
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:10,730
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Taught Directly from</font>

33
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:10,730
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">the
Perverted
Sage</font>

34
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:10,730
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">It's the</font>

35
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:10,730
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Summoning Technique!!</font>

36
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, well...</font>

37
00:02:41,510 --> 00:02:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't sleep at all?</font>

38
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you want?</font>

39
00:02:47,850 --> 00:02:51,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I'd crush you now.</font>

40
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:55,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I do that,
there'd be the possibility for me,</font>

41
00:02:55,980 --> 00:02:59,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after the first battle,
to be able to fight Sasuke-kun.</font>

42
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:04,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know your Sand attack.</font>

43
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder which is faster,
yours or my Sound.</font>

44
00:03:27,390 --> 00:03:28,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the full moon...</font>

45
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the full moon, his blood boils.</font>

46
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:48,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell... are you?</font>

47
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:24,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amazing... So that's his true form?</font>

48
00:04:25,910 --> 00:04:29,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... is it okay?
He's a Sound Ninja...</font>

49
00:04:30,370 --> 00:04:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right.
He's long since served his purpose.</font>

50
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:37,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought he was a guinea pig
in order to see...</font>

51
00:04:38,420 --> 00:04:40,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the power of the boy
called Sasuke or something...</font>

52
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:45,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... is he with the Sand Ninja?</font>

53
00:04:46,930 --> 00:04:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not necessary anymore...</font>

54
00:04:50,390 --> 00:04:54,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, I'd already been ordered
to seize Sasuke-kun.</font>

55
00:04:54,770 --> 00:04:57,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I failed...</font>

56
00:04:57,980 --> 00:05:00,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?
That's right.</font>

57
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...for the likes of you?</font>

58
00:05:02,940 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you looking to take me on?</font>

59
00:05:05,780 --> 00:05:12,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You willful little brat...
Don't mess around with grown-ups.</font>

60
00:05:12,830 --> 00:05:18,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so arrogant.
The situation is in my favor.</font>

61
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's also been found out that
I'm a minion of the Sound.</font>

62
00:05:30,890 --> 00:05:36,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... if they find out that you're
having a secret meeting here with me...</font>

63
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:41,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the plan to destroy the Leaf Village
and everything will be for naught!</font>

64
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:46,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I heard...
that you're Orochimaru's right-hand man.</font>

65
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:50,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being revealed to them and coming
nonchalantly to meet with me...</font>

66
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:53,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must be a fool.</font>

67
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:59,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... to be exact, my true identity
wasn't found out...</font>

68
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I let them find out.</font>

69
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to see how far
the Leaf Village would go...</font>

70
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:12,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even after that it wouldn't
be too late to seize Sasuke-kun.</font>

71
00:06:12,810 --> 00:06:16,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you guys are going to fail,
we'll back off immediately...</font>

72
00:06:16,980 --> 00:06:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a plan that was originally
posed by the Sound, so.</font>

73
00:06:23,940 --> 00:06:26,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Sand is invisible until
the last moment.</font>

74
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the will of the Kazekage.</font>

75
00:06:30,490 --> 00:06:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Holy crap...</font>

76
00:06:32,580 --> 00:06:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's fine.</font>

77
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:37,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the carry-out plan from Sound.</font>

78
00:06:37,910 --> 00:06:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

79
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And please... tell them about
this plan soon.</font>

80
00:06:46,590 --> 00:06:47,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

81
00:06:48,590 --> 00:06:49,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

82
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:53,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I'll be going.</font>

83
00:06:54,510 --> 00:06:56,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think our allied nation,
the Village Hidden in the Sand,</font>

84
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has been already associated
with the Sound...?!</font>

85
00:06:59,770 --> 00:07:01,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must tell Hokage-sama about this quick.</font>

86
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, by the way...</font>

87
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take care of the clean up.</font>

88
00:07:09,490 --> 00:07:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'll do it...</font>

89
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:14,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As the member of Sand Village
of the Land of Wind,</font>

90
00:07:14,450 --> 00:07:17,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must do what I can for my allies...</font>

91
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides... it's just one mouse.</font>

92
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:23,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be easy.</font>

93
00:07:39,770 --> 00:07:42,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well well, it's Proctor.</font>

94
00:07:44,980 --> 00:07:48,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world are you
doing here alone?</font>

95
00:07:50,570 --> 00:07:52,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems I have no choice,
but to fight.</font>

96
00:08:19,930 --> 00:08:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Style...</font>

97
00:08:21,020 --> 00:08:22,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Crescent Moon Dance!</font>

98
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:42,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't pull it out.</font>

99
00:08:43,410 --> 00:08:47,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This technique is...
the Leaf Style Crescent Moon Dance.</font>

100
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:49,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Being able to manage it
at such a young age.</font>

101
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:53,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As expected,
this village is full of talented Ninja.</font>

102
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your talent with a sword is superb.</font>

103
00:08:57,720 --> 00:09:02,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, a real sword with substance
can be stopped.</font>

104
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However... a Wind sword can't
be stopped by anyone.</font>

105
00:09:21,870 --> 00:09:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that!</font>

106
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:25,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That does it!</font>

107
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice, nice.</font>

108
00:09:37,470 --> 00:09:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

109
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is paradise.</font>

110
00:09:42,930 --> 00:09:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, I said.</font>

111
00:09:58,280 --> 00:10:01,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it time for you to turn
this way already?</font>

112
00:10:01,830 --> 00:10:07,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you join my training,
I'll give you lots of "service".</font>

113
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">P-l-e-a-s-e.</font>

114
00:10:10,460 --> 00:10:14,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you finally came out...
I was waiting for you.</font>

115
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:19,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

116
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:26,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you making fun of me?</font>

117
00:10:27,230 --> 00:10:29,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right back at you.</font>

118
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hungry.</font>

119
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:33,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's get back to the inn.</font>

120
00:10:35,860 --> 00:10:38,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow, damn it!</font>

121
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay... I'll teach you a technique.</font>

122
00:10:45,660 --> 00:10:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you really mean that?</font>

123
00:10:51,250 --> 00:10:55,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you remember what I told you
yesterday about the two types of Chakra?</font>

124
00:10:56,090 --> 00:10:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Yesterday's talk?</font>

125
00:10:58,300 --> 00:11:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, what you said about blue
and red Chakra or something.</font>

126
00:11:03,550 --> 00:11:06,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... What about it?</font>

127
00:11:06,430 --> 00:11:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said that when a great power
came out, you felt red Chakra.</font>

128
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, it was like that.</font>

129
00:11:13,900 --> 00:11:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Try building up that red Chakra right now.</font>

130
00:11:17,690 --> 00:11:21,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm. Even you say so...</font>

131
00:11:21,860 --> 00:11:23,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give it a try, but...</font>

132
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:36,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it?</font>

133
00:11:36,420 --> 00:11:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm, it's not right.</font>

134
00:11:39,420 --> 00:11:41,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same Chakra as always.</font>

135
00:11:41,590 --> 00:11:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, you have no talent.</font>

136
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be talking all high and mighty!</font>

137
00:11:48,390 --> 00:11:49,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the first place,</font>

138
00:11:49,390 --> 00:11:52,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really don't understand those
two types of Chakra myself!</font>

139
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:55,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just keep trying.</font>

140
00:12:01,450 --> 00:12:05,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... So he doesn't understand it...
himself, eh.</font>

141
00:12:06,700 --> 00:12:08,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems Naruto himself still hasn't
