<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the red Chakra is
the Nine-Tailed Fox's Chakra.</font>

143
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, guessing from his story...</font>

144
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:24,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it seems the excitement of danger
and heightened emotion</font>

145
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:27,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are the key to summon
the Nine-Tailed Fox Chakra.</font>

146
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good, not good.</font>

147
00:12:30,430 --> 00:12:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only the usual Chakras coming out.</font>

148
