<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Pervy Sage...</font>

149
00:12:35,190 --> 00:12:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck does the red Chakra and
the technique you're going to teach me</font>

150
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have to do with each other?</font>

151
00:12:41,570 --> 00:12:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, boy.</font>

152
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the technique
I'm about to teach you,</font>

153
00:12:46,870 --> 00:12:50,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Chakra you've had until now
is not nearly enough.</font>

154
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:56,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, you'll have to be able to
pull out and use the "other" Chakra</font>

155
00:12:56,710 --> 00:13:00,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that has been dormant within
you at any time you need.</font>

156
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:07,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But how do you know that
I have such a Chakra?</font>

157
00:13:07,890 --> 00:13:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, just what I wanted to hear.</font>

158
00:13:11,220 --> 00:13:12,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually...</font>

159
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's because I'm a sage.</font>

160
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:19,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez... that's no answer.</font>

161
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:22,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, the special Chakra
that only you have</font>

162
00:13:22,690 --> 00:13:25,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will become your greatest weapon.</font>

163
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Greatest weapon?</font>

164
00:13:28,620 --> 00:13:32,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not using that is like wasting treasure.</font>

165
00:13:32,490 --> 00:13:35,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to forcedly do
the same training as everyone else.</font>

166
00:13:36,330 --> 00:13:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone has what they're good at
and poor at.</font>

167
00:13:39,670 --> 00:13:42,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have your own style.</font>

168
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:48,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your training until now, maintaining
and releasing a set amount of Chakra,</font>

169
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was in other words,</font>

170
00:13:50,470 --> 00:13:54,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">training to control the suppression of
Chakra so that you wouldn't get exhausted.</font>

171
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you who have a lot of stamina</font>

172
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">should be about power rather
than a cheap trick.</font>

173
00:14:03,730 --> 00:14:06,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, who has two types of Chakra
and doesn't exhaust easily,</font>

174
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">should release the largest amount
of Chakra you can</font>

175
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and train to increase the absolute amount
of Chakra that you can use.</font>

176
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then there are tons of Jutsu
and techniques you can use.</font>

177
00:14:20,420 --> 00:14:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, for example?</font>

178
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:29,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example... summoning Jutsu
that I'm going to teach you now.</font>

179
00:14:33,220 --> 00:14:34,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning?</font>

180
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

181
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a type of spatio-temporal technique</font>

